<div class="page-content page-full">

  {%- render 'breadcrumbs' -%}

  <div class="page-width">
    <header class="section-header">
      <h1 class="section-header__title">{{ page.title }}</h1>
    </header>
  </div>

  <div class="rte rte--nomargin">
    {{ page.content }}
  </div>

</div>
{% comment %}
  

{% if page.url == '/pages/main-faqs' %}
<script type="application/ld+json"> 
{ 
  "@context": "https://schema.org", 
  "@type": "FAQPage", 
  "mainEntity": [{ 
    "@type": "Question", 
    "name": "Having Problem Accessing Websites?", 
    "acceptedAnswer": { 
      "@type": "Answer", 
      "text": "We suggest that you have the latest version of your operating system provider 
e.g. Windows, OSX etc. If you're still having problems, contact our Customer Care Team and 
include: 
As much detail as you can about the issue Screen shots of any error message you get 
Which web browser you are using (e.g. Internet Explorer, Firefox, Chrome, Safari etc.) 
What you have done so far to try to resolve it" 
    } 
  },{ 
    "@type": "Question", 
    "name": "If My Article Is Out Of Stock Will That Article Be Replenished Again?", 
    "acceptedAnswer": { 
      "@type": "Answer", 
      "text": "We don't currently have the facility to let you know if or when an item is due back 
in stock. As we like to offer you new and exciting products regularly we don't tend to restock 
a lot of our items again.We are always looking at improving your shopping experience so if 
this changes, we'll let you know. You could also look for something similar – all you need to 
do is type a product description into the search box on our website. You can narrow down 
the selection by using our 'Search' section on the right-hand side of the screen. Our New 
Arrivals section includes all our latest items, so it's always worth a look!" 
    } 
  },{ 
    "@type": "Question", 
    "name": "What Is Your Shipping Policy?", 
    "acceptedAnswer": { 
      "@type": "Answer", 
      "text": "We cater to customers located within India only. At present we do not accept 
orders for international shipping. We undertake to ship your orders anywhere in India. We 
are committed to delivering your order accurately, in good condition, and on time.  We do not 
charge you for Shipping. However, we charge a flat fee of Rs. 49 on COD orders. We ship 
on all week days (Monday to Saturday), excluding public holidays. We generally ship out 
orders from our warehouse within 48 hours of orders receipt and the orders should reach 
you within 5 - 7 days. We have tied up with several logistics partners for smooth deliveries 
across India. All your shipment related queries would be addressed directly by our customer 
support team" 
    } 
  },{ 
    "@type": "Question", 
 
    "name": "What Is Your Exchange Policy?", 
    "acceptedAnswer": { 
      "@type": "Answer", 
      "text": "You can exchange the product bought from our website within 7 days from order 
delivery date, for any reason including SIZE Change, no questions asked, as long as it is 
returned to us in its original packaging, in unused condition with all Tags and Labels intact, 
and is accompanied with its Original bill. We provide reverse pick up facility for most of the 
locations in India however, for locations where the reverse pick up facility is still not available 
for return/exchange, the customer needs to send the package to our warehouse address. 
Kindly get in touch with the Customer Care team for any assistance. If you want to exchange 
your bought product with a different product, having a different selling price, then you should 
cancel your original order by booking a return on our website and place a new order" 
    } 
  },{ 
    "@type": "Question", 
    "name": "What Is Your Claim Policy?", 
    "acceptedAnswer": { 
      "@type": "Answer", 
      "text": "100% claim is allowed if there is any manufacturing defect in the product within 1 
month of purchase with the copy of the bill. Product older than 1 month & under 3 months 
has to be sent to us with Original bill, please ensure that the defect claimed is genuine i.e. no 
external defect has been caused intentionally or un-intentionally especially by Rough usage, 
Dog bites, Silencer burns, Usage of Razor / Blunt object etc. An approval will be provided by 
us based on the genuineness, usage & repair-ability. If unrepairable the claim value may 
vary from 50 to 100% of the product's price. No Claims will be entertained under any 
circumstances of product more than 3 months old." 
    } 
  },{ 
    "@type": "Question", 
    "name": "What Is Your Refund Policy?", 
    "acceptedAnswer": { 
      "@type": "Answer", 
      "text": "In case of Order cancellations and Returns related to Prepaid orders, we will 
refund the money the same way as the payment was made. If the payment was made by 
Credit Card/Debit Card or Net-Banking, we will refund the amount within 7 to 12 working 
days only after receipt of product in its original condition (for Returns only) In case of Returns 
related to COD Orders, we will refund the money, in form of Credit Points only in your 
account, only after receipt of product in its original condition. These credit points can be used 
for purchases on our website. In case of Claims, we will provide Credit Points in your 
account, as per our Claims policy. These credit points can be used for purchases on our 
website." 
    } 
  }] 
} 
</script> 
{% endif %}
{% endcomment %}